sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 🌐 Client
    participant API as 🚪 API Gateway<br/>(REST/gRPC)
    participant Handlers as 🔄 Unified Handlers
    participant VOS as ⚡ VectorOperationsService
    participant CS as 📁 CollectionService
    participant Engine as 💾 Storage Engine<br/>(VIPER/SST)
    participant WAL as 📝 Write-Ahead Log
    participant Memtable as 🧠 Memtable
    participant Index as 🔍 Index Layer
    participant Cache as 🗄️ Cache Orchestrator
    participant TxCoord as 🔄 Transaction Coordinator
    participant Compression as 🗜️ Compression Module
    participant Hardware as 🚀 Hardware Layer
    participant Metrics as 📊 Metrics

    %% === COLLECTION CREATION FLOW ===
    Note over Client,Metrics: 📋 Collection Creation with Storage Assignment

    Client->>+API: POST /collections<br/>CollectionConfig + compression settings
    API->>+Handlers: handle_collection_operation()<br/>JSON → Proto conversion
    Handlers->>+CS: create_collection()<br/>with storage_assignment
    
    CS->>CS: Generate collection metadata<br/>assign storage locations
    CS->>+Engine: initialize_storage()<br/>data_location, wal_location
    Engine->>+TxCoord: setup_collection_storage()<br/>atomic directory creation
    TxCoord->>TxCoord: Create staging directories<br/>prepare atomic operation
    TxCoord-->>-Engine: Storage paths ready
    Engine-->>-CS: Collection storage initialized
    CS->>CS: Persist collection metadata<br/>with storage_assignment
    CS-->>-Handlers: Collection created successfully
    Handlers-->>-API: Proto → JSON response
    API-->>-Client: Collection details + ID
    
    %% === VECTOR INSERT FLOW ===
    Note over Client,Metrics: 📥 High-Performance Vector Insert (17K vec/s gRPC)

    Client->>+API: POST /collections/{id}/vectors<br/>Batch of 500 vectors
    API->>+Handlers: handle_vector_batch()<br/>validate & convert
    Handlers->>+VOS: insert_vectors_direct()<br/>Direct memtable access
    
    VOS->>+CS: get_collection_metadata(id)<br/>get storage_assignment
    CS-->>-VOS: Collection + storage locations
    
    VOS->>+Compression: compress_batch()<br/>SDK-driven compression config
    Compression->>Compression: Apply unified compression<br/>ZSTD/LZ4/Snappy based on config
    Compression-->>-VOS: Compressed vector batch
    
    par Parallel Write Operations
        VOS->>+WAL: append_batch(vectors)<br/>Proto serialization
        WAL->>WAL: Serialize to protobuf<br/>durability guarantee
        WAL-->>-VOS: WAL position confirmed
    and
        VOS->>+Memtable: insert_batch(vectors)<br/>In-memory buffer
        Memtable->>Memtable: Store vectors in memory<br/>fast write access
        Memtable-->>-VOS: Insert confirmed
    and
        VOS->>+Index: add_vectors(batch)<br/>Update search indexes
        Index->>Hardware: detect_hardware_capabilities()<br/>GPU/SIMD optimization
        Hardware-->>Index: Hardware profile
        Index->>Index: Update HNSW/IVF/LSH indexes<br/>with hardware acceleration
        Index-->>-VOS: Index updated
    end
    
    VOS->>+Cache: invalidate_cache(vector_ids)<br/>Maintain consistency
    Cache->>Cache: Cascade invalidation<br/>query cache, metadata cache
    Cache-->>-VOS: Cache cleared
    
    VOS->>+Metrics: record_insert(count, latency)<br/>Performance tracking
    Metrics-->>-VOS: Metrics recorded
    
    alt Flush Threshold Reached
        Note over Memtable,Engine: 🔄 Automatic Flush Process
        Memtable->>+Engine: trigger_flush()<br/>Memory → Disk persistence
        Engine->>+Compression: compress_for_storage()<br/>Engine-specific compression
        Compression-->>-Engine: Compressed data blocks
        Engine->>+TxCoord: begin_atomic_flush()<br/>ACID guarantees
        TxCoord->>TxCoord: Write to staging<br/>prepare atomic operation
        TxCoord->>TxCoord: Finalize operation<br/>move staging → final
        TxCoord-->>-Engine: Flush completed atomically
        Engine-->>-Memtable: Flush acknowledged
        Memtable->>Memtable: Clear flushed data<br/>reclaim memory
    end
    
    VOS-->>-Handlers: Insert batch completed
    Handlers-->>-API: Proto → JSON response
    API-->>-Client: Insert statistics<br/>{success: true, count: 500}

    %% === VECTOR SEARCH FLOW ===
    Note over Client,Metrics: 🔍 Intelligent Vector Search (0.9ms p99 latency)

    Client->>+API: POST /search<br/>Query vector + metadata filters
    API->>+Handlers: handle_vector_search()<br/>Parse search parameters
    Handlers->>+VOS: search_vectors()<br/>Intelligent routing
    
    VOS->>+CS: get_collection_metadata(id)<br/>Check compression config
    CS-->>-VOS: Collection config + storage info
    
    VOS->>+Cache: check_query_cache(query_hash)<br/>Cache lookup first
    Cache-->>-VOS: Cache miss (or cached results)
    
    alt Cache Miss - Execute Search
        VOS->>+Engine: search_vectors_unified()<br/>Engine-specific optimization
        
        par Dual Engine Search Strategy
            Note over Engine: VIPER Engine Search
            Engine->>+Compression: decompress_for_search()<br/>Selective decompression
            Compression-->>-Engine: Decompressed data blocks
            Engine->>Engine: Search columnar data<br/>predicate pushdown
            Engine->>Engine: Two-stage search<br/>Quantized → FP32 reranking
        and
            Note over Engine: SST Engine Search  
            Engine->>Engine: Hierarchical bloom filtering<br/>95% block skip rate
            Engine->>Engine: Three-stage filtering<br/>File→Block→Record
            Engine->>+Hardware: simd_distance_compute()<br/>AVX2/AVX-512 acceleration
            Hardware-->>-Engine: Accelerated distances
        end
        
        Engine->>Engine: MVCC resolution<br/>Handle multiple versions
        Engine->>Engine: Multi-tier deduplication<br/>Merge engine results
        Engine-->>-VOS: Search results
        
        VOS->>+Cache: cache_results(query_hash, results)<br/>Cache for future queries
        Cache-->>-VOS: Results cached
    end
    
    VOS->>+Metrics: record_search(latency, result_count)<br/>Performance tracking
    Metrics-->>-VOS: Search metrics recorded
    
    VOS-->>-Handlers: Search results
    Handlers-->>-API: Proto → JSON response
    API-->>-Client: Ranked results<br/>with similarity scores

    %% === SQL QUERY FLOW ===
    Note over Client,Metrics: 🗄️ GPU/SIMD-Accelerated SQL Processing

    Client->>+API: POST /query<br/>SQL with VECTOR_SIMILARITY
    API->>+Handlers: handle_sql_query()<br/>Parse SQL query
    Handlers->>+VOS: execute_sql()<br/>Vector-aware SQL execution
    
    VOS->>+Hardware: get_capabilities()<br/>Check GPU/SIMD availability
    Hardware-->>-VOS: Hardware profile<br/>GPU: CUDA, CPU: AVX2
    
    alt GPU Available
        VOS->>+Hardware: parse_sql_gpu()<br/>GPU-accelerated parsing
        Hardware->>Hardware: Tokenize on GPU<br/>CUDA/ROCm parallel processing
        Hardware->>Hardware: Parse grammar on CPU<br/>Structured query plan
        Hardware-->>-VOS: Optimized query plan
    else SIMD Fallback
        VOS->>+Hardware: parse_vector_simd()<br/>SIMD vector parsing
        Hardware->>Hardware: AVX2 parallel parsing<br/>8 elements per instruction
        Hardware-->>-VOS: Parsed query components
    end
    
    VOS->>+Engine: execute_vector_query()<br/>Optimized vector search in SQL
    Engine->>Engine: Apply WHERE clauses<br/>Metadata filtering
    Engine->>Engine: Execute VECTOR_SIMILARITY<br/>Similarity search with ranking
    Engine->>Engine: Apply ORDER BY/LIMIT<br/>Result ranking and pagination
    Engine-->>-VOS: SQL query results
    
    VOS-->>-Handlers: Query results
    Handlers-->>-API: Proto → JSON response
    API-->>-Client: SQL result set<br/>Sub-2ms query time

    %% === ERROR HANDLING FLOW ===
    Note over Client,Metrics: ⚠️ Error Handling & Recovery

    Client->>+API: Invalid request<br/>Malformed data
    API->>+Handlers: handle_request()<br/>Request validation
    Handlers->>Handlers: Schema validation<br/>Proto/JSON validation
    Handlers-->>-API: ValidationError<br/>Detailed error information
    API-->>-Client: HTTP 400<br/>Actionable error message

