        Note over Hardware: **⚡ Hardware Acceleration**<br/>• Auto GPU/SIMD detection<br/>• CUDA/ROCm/MPS support<br/>• AVX2/AVX-512 optimization<br/>• 163MB/s SIMD throughput
    end